    "innovation": "This paper presents new estimates of Earth\u2019s hemispheric energy balance from an assembly of observational data and reviews recent climate model simulations, concluding that correcting hemispheric energy imbalances in fully coupled models does not fix persistent tropical precipitation biases.",
